msgid "Build Dawn from source"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../modules/vtk-modules/Rendering/WebGPU/README.md:52
msgid ""
"Dawn should be built at tag [v20260720.160313](https://github.com/google/"
"dawn/tree/v20260720.160313). Here, `DAWN_INSTALL_DIR` should point to the "
"directory where Dawn is installed (should contain `lib` and `include` "
"directories)."
